-- 1. The launch letter: everyone, the version letter of the launch (RoleBriefings.LAUNCH_VERSION).
L.RB_LAUNCH_TITLE = "The gates are open"
L.RB_LAUNCH = "To the army of Olympus,\n\nThe beta is ended. Olympus is live.\n\nNot long ago this was a few guilds and an idea. Today it is one army and one realm, and every one of you stands within it.\n\nEvery office now receives its own letter, and every guild master a checklist in his. The rest is in your hands.\n\nFern has raised us a guild hall: olympus.roachcouncil.com. Those in the Discord may sign in there and pass the gates. To Fern, our thanks.\n\nKeep a civil tongue in chat. Help the new. Bring your friends.\n\nPlay well."

